This is an independent (released) fork: as of June 2026 it no longer
tracks, merges, or cherry-picks changes from upstream LibreClinica.

Upstream heritage
-----------------
Built on LibreClinica, the community-driven successor of OpenClinica.

LibreClinica is primarily maintained by ReliaTec GmbH
  (Ralph Heerlein, Christian Hänsel, Otmar Bayer), with contributions from:
  - Julia Bley, University Hospital RWTH Aachen
  - Thomas Hillger, University Hospital RWTH Aachen
  - Gerben Rienk Visser, Trial Data Solutions
  - Tomas Skripcak, DKFZ Partner Site Dresden (DKTK)

LibreClinica was forked in 2019 from OpenClinica 3.14.
All upstream copyright notices are retained.
